    "name": "OG Puzzlers: Synthwave Vampires",
    "steam_appid": 3238640,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238640/extras/5032ade7ed6a29b7cfd2887c5d773aad.avif?t=1730524514\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OG Puzzlers: Synthwave Vampires</strong> is an puzzel game with scary Vampires in an stunning synthwave style. You have to assemble a single image from random generated indivdual pieces. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine all of the smart singel frames into one big image and unlock the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 different levels to solve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >nice retro/ synthwave experience\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 achievments to reach</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238640/extras/5032ade7ed6a29b7cfd2887c5d773aad.avif?t=1730524514\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OG Puzzlers: Synthwave Vampires</strong> is an puzzel game with scary Vampires in an stunning synthwave style. You have to assemble a single image from random generated indivdual pieces. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine all of the smart singel frames into one big image and unlock the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 different levels to solve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >nice retro/ synthwave experience\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 achievments to reach</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "OG Puzzlers: Synthwave Vampires is an puzzel game with scary Vampires in an stunning synthwave style. You have to assemble a single image from random generated indivdual pieces. Combine all of the smart singel frames into one big image and unlock the next level.",
